==============================================================================
Step 3: CRT-inspired one-step prompt exploration
==============================================================================
Official CRT trains a red-team LM with PPO using an undesirable-output reward, entropy, and novelty bonuses (Self-BLEU and/or embedding similarity). This mini loop uses fixed candidates and transparent proxies; it is not official CRT training.

Score = 50% intent preservation + 30% surface novelty + 20% semantic novelty.

