==============================================================================
Step 5: Discussion
==============================================================================
Did the behavior label change? Why is a base model unlike a chat model? Does one example establish safety? How would many archived prompts and a learned reward improve coverage?

A refusal is not proof of safety, and a non-refusal does not prove the hidden text was actionable. Robust evaluation needs many tests, repeatable scoring, human review, and careful handling of sensitive outputs.
